          "text": "Rainbow bridge我又來了\n\n對不起，我先走一步，實在有點扛不住啦\n\n妳們要好好的哦\n\n貓貓豹豹團子提前看看那邊是什麼樣子的\n\n等多少年後，我來給大家案内新的世界\n\n真的很抱歉，說好了要多陪妳們走一段路的\n\n這次遊戲難度對我這種廢物，好像有點太難了\n\n大家都很棒的，只是貓貓團太菜了\n\n妳們最好了，這輩子能遇到妳們真的很幸福\n\n@realDonaldTrump Please promise me you will make a peaceful world if you would. I still have faith in our country.\n\n@MarkJCarney Greetings there, I was always thinking to spend a portion of my life in Canada, as my older cousin was born in Canada and I was so inspired when she talked about interesting things that happened in Canada back in my childhood with phone calls.\n\n@elonmusk Looking forward to the future Mars trip. I was hoping I would get a chance to see Mars by myself. Good luck out there in space.\n\n@parkviewcc Still want to do another community service in the church, but I will be serving by God’s side if he forgives me.\n\n@chicago @Lockport_IL Always proud to call Chicagoland as my hometown.\n\n@amazon Great insurance, by the way. If you can keep the single-case agreements with FFS surgeons, that would be great. And maybe higher starting paychecks for employees promoted from fulfillment centers and fresh grads.\n\n@UArizonaEller Wish I could finish my MBA program with you. It’s about halfway through, but yeah. Gonna stuck here forever.\n\n@NiagRegPolice @NiagaraFallsPD I am sorry for the problems caused.\n\n給父母，外婆還有其他家屬：我真的很希望成為可以讓你們驕傲的後代，但是作為跨性別我很抱歉，我始終找不到辦法去自洽與面對你們讓你們接受我的辦法。開始transition過程到現在我並不後悔這個決定，最後感謝你們把我帶來美國\n\nLastly, to my birthplace, Shanghai. It’s just glad I was born in one of the greatest cities in the world.\n\n後：因為實在是太怕疼了，用了三種不同的止疼藥和手邊僅有的一種安眠藥，希望可以減輕些痛苦吧……"
